  "notes": "{深|ふか}める is an ichidan verb meaning to deepen, heighten, or intensify.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{深|ふか}まる→深まる：02406_fukamaru⟧ (intransitive: to deepen, become deeper)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{理解|りかい}→理解：03674_rikai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to deepen understanding\n- ⟦{知識|ちしき}→知識：01463_chishiki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to deepen knowledge\n- ⟦{絆|きずな}→絆：02509_kizuna⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to strengthen bonds\n- ⟦{交流|こうりゅう}→交流：02732_kouryuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to deepen exchanges\n- ⟦{友情|ゆうじょう}→友情：03648_yuujou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to deepen friendship\n- ⟦{関係|かんけい}→関係：01298_kankei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{深|ふか}める: to deepen a relationship\n\nUSAGE:\nOften used with abstract concepts like understanding, knowledge, or relationships rather than physical depth.",
